    ("en_US",  "LOC_WONDER_DOI_SUTHEP_TOOLTIP",   "+10 [icon:YIELD_CULTURE] Culture, [icon:YIELD_DIPLOMACY] Influence and [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold for every [icon:CITYSTATE] City-State you are [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SUZERAIN_TOOLTIP]Suzerain[/TIP] of.[n]Must be placed on [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_ROUGH_TERRAIN_TOOLTIP]Rough Terrain[/TIP]."),
